Package: mytooth
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, bluez, bluez-obexd
Recommends: network-manager, pipewire-pulse, wireplumber
Description: Bluetooth manager for Cinnamon using GTK and XApp
 Mytooth manages Bluetooth adapters, pairing and connections through BlueZ.
 It provides an XApp tray, incoming file approval and outgoing OBEX transfers,
 Bluetooth audio profile selection, and NetworkManager-backed PAN tethering.
 .
 Cinnamon on Wayland is the intended release environment. GTK's normal X11
 backend remains usable for development and transition testing.
